## Overview

ElectroBlueprint Kernel converts electronic design intent into structured blueprints and runs lightweight simulations on them.  
Every blueprint, manifest, and exported artifact embeds the identity:

**C MATTHEW BLACKWELL — INDEPENDENT DESIGNER**

Authorship is part of the data model.

